<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy – Mad Egg Labs`}
>
  <section>
    <h2>Privacy Policy for Mad Egg Labs, LLC</h2>
    <p><em>Effective Date: May 1, 2026</em></p>
    <p>At Mad Egg Labs, we believe your data belongs to you. Whether you are visiting our website or using our mobile applications, our philosophy is the same: we provide information, we don’t collect it.</p>
    <h3>Website data</h3>
    <aside>
      <p>Applies to: <em>MadEggLabs.com</em></p>
    </aside>
    <p>When you browse our website, you are anonymous to us.</p>
    <ul>

      <li><strong>No personal tracking or cookies:</strong> We do not use cookies, tracking pixels, or cross-site tracking identifiers. We do not collect, store, or share personally identifiable information.</li>
      <li><strong>Privacy-first analytics:</strong> We use <a href="https://umami.is">Umami Cloud</a> to collect basic, aggregated website usage statistics (such as page views, referrer sites, browser type, operating system, and approximate country-level location).</li>
      <li><strong>IP anonymization:</strong> IP addresses are processed temporarily to determine general geography and are not stored or associated with individual visitor sessions.</li>
      <li><strong>External links:</strong> This website may contain links to external sites. Mad Egg Labs is not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>App data</h3>
    <aside>
      <p>Applies to: <em><a href="/apps/is-it-yacht-rock/">Is it Yacht Rock?</a></em></p>
    </aside>
    <p>Our mobile applications are designed with privacy as a core feature.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Zero personal data:</strong> The app does not collect, transmit, or store any personally identifiable information (PII).</li>
      <li><strong>Audio privacy:</strong> Is it Yacht Rock? uses <a href="https://developer.apple.com/shazamkit/">ShazamKit</a> to identify music. Audio samples are processed locally on your device to create a “signature” which is then sent to Apple’s Shazam service. Their data usage is governed by <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/">Apple’s Privacy Policy</a>. Mad Egg Labs never hears, records, or stores your audio.</li>
      <li><strong>On-device storage:</strong> Your “Match History” is stored locally on your device using SwiftData. This data never leaves your device and is not accessible by Mad Egg Labs.</li>
      <li><strong>Apple analytics:</strong> If you have opted-in to share crash reports and usage statistics with developers via iOS settings, Apple may provide us with anonymous, aggregated data. This cannot be used to identify you.</li>
      <li><strong>External links:</strong> Is it Yacht Rock? may contain links to external sites. Mad Egg Labs is not responsible for the privacy practices of external sites.</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Contacting us</h3>
    <p>If you choose to contact us via email, we will only use your email address to respond to your inquiry. We will never sell your contact information or add you to a marketing list without your explicit permission.</p>
    <h3>Changes to this policy</h3>
    <p>If we ever change how our site or apps work, we will update this page. However, our core philosophy will always be to provide information, not collect it.</p>
    <p>Questions? Reach out to us at <span class="email-link" data-user="privacy"></span>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
